      *%METADATA                                                       *
      * %TEXT PEEK400 - Customer (History)                             *
      *%EMETADATA                                                      *
      * =================================================================== *
      *   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                                  *
      *     >>CRTCMD<<  CRTPF         FILE(&LI/&OB) +                       *
      *                               SRCFILE(&SL/&SF) SRCMBR(&SM);         *
      *     >>IMPORTANT<<                                                   *
      *       >>PARM<<                MBR(*NONE);                           *
      *       >>PARM<<                MAXMBRS(10);                          *
      *     >>END-IMPORTANT<<                                               *
      *     >>EXECUTE<<                                                     *
      *     >>CMD<<     ADDPFM FILE(&LI/&OB) MBR(Y2017);                    *
      *     >>CMD<<     ADDPFM FILE(&LI/&OB) MBR(Y2018);                    *
      *   >>END-PRE-COMPILER<<                                              *
      * =================================================================== *
     A                                      UNIQUE
      *
     A          R FCUSTOMER                 TEXT('Customers')
      *
     A            CUSTNBR       10S 0       TEXT('Customer number')
     A                                      COLHDG('Customer number')
     A            NAME          40A         TEXT('First and last name')
     A                                      COLHDG('First and last name')
     A            STREET        40A         TEXT('Street')
     A                                      COLHDG('Street')
     A            ZIPCODE       10A         TEXT('Zip code')
     A                                      COLHDG('Zip code')
     A            CITY          40A         TEXT('City')
     A                                      COLHDG('City')
     A            COUNTRY       40A         TEXT('Country')
     A                                      COLHDG('Country')
      *
     A          K CUSTNBR
      *
